<%- include('partials/header') %>
<%- include('partials/navbar') %>

<div class="container">
  <div class="page-heading">
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1>Privacy &amp; Cookie Policy</h1>
  </div>

  <div style="max-width: 720px; margin: 40px 0 100px; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8;">
    <h3 style="color: var(--color-cream); font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;">What Cookies We Use</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
      Zeenat uses cookies to keep you logged in, remember what's in your shopping cart between visits,
      and understand how our site is used so we can improve it. We do not sell your personal data to third parties.
    </p>

    <h3 style="color: var(--color-cream); font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Information We Collect</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
      When you create an account, we store your name, email address, and a securely hashed version of your password.
      When you place an order, we store your shipping details so we can fulfil it. We never store your card details on our servers.
    </p>

    <h3 style="color: var(--color-cream); font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Affiliate Links</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
      Some products on Zeenat are sold through partner stores. Clicking "Buy Now" on these products will take you to
      the partner's website to complete your purchase, and Zeenat may earn a commission on qualifying purchases at no
      extra cost to you.
    </p>

    <h3 style="color: var(--color-cream); font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Your Choices</h3>
    <p>
      You can clear cookies at any time through your browser settings. Doing so may log you out or clear your saved cart.
      For any questions about this policy, reach out to us at the contact details in our footer.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
